    <string name="support_title">Help and support</string>
    <string name="support_text">USB: use a data cable and enable USB debugging. On your desktop, open Connection and choose Set up USB connection. Accept the debugging prompt on your tablet.\n\nWi-Fi: connect both devices to the same network. Enable paired Wi-Fi connections in desktop Preferences, restart the server, then copy the pairing details to this tablet.\n\nNo pen input: check your connection, then test the pen in a desktop application. On Linux, check input permissions in Preferences. Windows pen input is experimental.</string>
